<p>This is a link to a file with a space in the filename:

<a href="../files-to-be-copied-to-static/foo/unicorn%20logo.png">Link to <code>unicorn logo.png</code></a></p>
<h3 id="inline-hyperlinked-and-non-hyperlinked-images">Inline hyperlinked and non-hyperlinked images</h3>
<p>This tests the feature added to support proper export syntax for
inline images – .</p>
<h4 id="inline-non-hyperlinked-image">Inline non-hyperlinked image</h4>
<h5 id="no-alt-text-or-any-other-attributes">No Alt text or any other attributes</h5>
