<p>The caption can contain be emphasized using the usual markup
characters too.</p>















<table><caption>Awesome table</caption><thead><tr><th>h1</th><th>h2</th><th>h3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>abc</td><td>def</td><td>ghi</td></tr></tbody></table>
