code block does not have Markdown syntax lists.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>List item 1</p>
<pre><code class="language-md">*abc*
/def/
=def=
</code></pre>
</li>
<li>
<p>List item 2</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<p></p>
<ol>
