<h3 id="front-matter-values-with-bigints">Front-matter values with BigInts</h3>
<div class="description">
<p>Test that front-matter values that are integers represented as
strings, but cannot be stored as 64-bit signed integers are
left as strings.</p>
</div>
<p>In this test, the small integer “234” (i.e. the one that can be
represented as a 64-bit signed integer) is saved as an integer in the
TOML front-matter.</p>
<p>But the big integer “10040216507682529280” which would need more than
64-bits to be stored as a signed integer is left as a string in the
TOML front-matter.</p>
