<li>Green ordered list item 2</li>
</ol>
<p><em>The <code>green-text</code> style is defined in the list above this one.</em></p>
<h5 id="ordered-list-with-custom-counter">Ordered list with custom counter</h5>
<ol>
<li>Blue list item 1</li>
<li>Blue list item 2</li>
<li value="10">Blue list item 10</li>
</ol>
<h4 id="definitiondescriptive-lists">Definition/descriptive lists</h4>
