<h4 id="source-and-example-blocks-in-lists">Source and example blocks in lists</h4>
<div class="description">
<p>Test to verify rendering of source and example blocks in lists.</p>
</div>
<p><a href="https://discourse.gohugo.io/t/blackfriday-not-handling-lists-and-code-blocks-the-right-way/19932">Ref</a></p>
<ul>
<li>
